@929. Everything sharp = deceit, or cunning.

@934. Swords and sharp points -acumina- appear whenever a Soul speaks otherwise than he thinks. Explained.

@1057. Spiritual things are represented by the sharper things...

@2621. (David) is sharp, or pernicious.

