@560[3]. Interior falsities are there represented by sharp things. Enumerated.

@780[8]. "Sharp above the wolves of evening" (Habakkuk 1:8) = the cunning of deceiving by fallacies.

@908[2]. "Sharp" (Revelation 14) = accurate, exquisite, and completely. Illustrated.

