@1201. That "Sidon" = these Knowledges, is evident from the fact that Tyre and Sidon were the ultimate boundaries of Philistia, and in fact near the sea; and therefore "Tyre" = the interior, and "Sidon," the exterior Knowledges. Illustrated.

