@9995[6]. "The woman in Sidon" (1 Kings 17:9) = the Church which is in the Knowledges of truth and good.

@AR 238[5]. Tyre and Sidon, because near the sea, = the Church as to the Knowledges of good and truth.

@AE 242[12]. "Tyre and Sidon" = those within the Church who are in the Knowledges of good and truth; here (Joel 3:4), those who have perverted them, and have applied them to falsities and the evils of falsity. @433[14].

