@TCR 675[2]. Represented, and thence signified.

@AE 405[24]. Whatever the Lord did in the world, represented; and whatever He spoke, signified. The reason He was in representatives and significatives then, was that He might be in the ultimates of Heaven and the Church and in their primes at the same time... Representatives and significatives are in ultimates.

@DeVerbo 4. In the Third Heaven it is known what the very letters signify.

