@1382[end]. Hence (the Angels) have no solicitude about future things.

@1389. In the life of the body there inflow... solicitudes about future things; (but not there). @SE 2188.

@1773[3]. Delighted with the Word, but not solicitous about the understanding of it.

@1941[2]. (Here) the seed... is in the midst of jungles and thickets, which are... cares and solicitudes... but when these are put off (there) the seed grows.

@2892[end]. He who believes that he rules himself... is borne into solicitudes about future things.

